  // D-14: front-facing wording is the owner's, taken as one pass.
  var CALL_RECORD_HEAD = 'here are the activity logs of the brain of your librarian';

  // ⚠ HER SENTENCE, BYTE-FOR-BYTE from 26.99-COPY.md §S-03b. ⛔ Not
