  var RECORD_DELETE_REFUSED = 'the room cannot delete the logs because your computer refused. the logs are still here.';

  // ⭐⭐ 26.99955-12 — HER READABILITY RULING, 2026-08-26, verbatim:
  //
  //   "can you also improve the readability on the activity log too? And
  //    also the clear log need to placed on the top of the activity log?"
  //
  // ⛔⛔ THE JOIN WAS THE RENDERER'S, NEVER HERS — the same flattening
  // 26.99955-11 removed from the sibling card one commit earlier. A helper
  // named `callRecordLine` used to hand `renderCallRecord` ONE string per
  // row: the date, the job's room-word, the provider and model, and the two
  // token counts, all concatenated with an em dash. The renderer then
