  //
  // ⚠ THIS IS A POLICY LAYER ON TOP OF THE LAW-5 FENCE, NEVER A REPLACEMENT
  // FOR IT. The guard (core.js guardSurface) is threaded as an ARGUMENT
  // through packArrivalDays and re-run on EVERY render; it decides FIRST and
