  //  3. `items` — the store's OWN directory name, and `07-27`'s only
  //     survivor. Naming it is the app talking about its own plumbing rather
  //     than about a place in her vault.
  //
  // MATCHING IS EXACT: a literal entry is compared by case-sensitive string
  // equality against the STORED folder value, with NO trimming, NO case fold
  // and NO Unicode normalisation. `Items` and `items ` are DIFFERENT folders
  // from `items` and are each judged on their own membership. A fold added
