    // is a loop on a full recursive walk of her whole vault.
    //
    // ⚠ AND IF THE OFFERED LIST WAS ALREADY FILLED, the pane keeps what
    // it had and does not ask again — the third guard still holds after a
    // failure too. ⛔ That is correct rather than a bug, and it is said
