  // SEAM-PANE-BEGIN: rosterPane
  // ---- 26.96-02 (M1): THE SEAM — ONE roster editor, TWO hosts ------------
  //
  // The list, the empty state, the fixed-height scroll, the add row and the
  // note slot live here and NOWHERE ELSE. The pre-import disclosure screen
  // and the Manage pane each build their own heading and their own framing
