      // -- 26.96-27: THE PICKER, INSIDE THE SHARED RENDERER --------------
      //
      // ⛔⛔ ITS MARKUP LIVES HERE AND NOWHERE ELSE. Emitted at the Manage
      // pane's own call site it would ship on ONE screen with the entire
