      // baseline. `hostCoverage` is the gate that says so, and the fix for a
      // violation there is to move the control back INTO this renderer.
      //
      // ⛔ HER D-B-POSITION RULING: the box sits WHERE THE TYPING BOX SITS
      // TODAY — below her private folders, near the bottom of the pane. So
      // the offered names sit directly above the receipt slot and the typing
