      //
      // ⚠ HER D-D RULING: this list is DELIBERATELY DIFFERENT TO LOOK AT from
      // the one on the bringing-in screen, and she separately ruled — asked
      // after the look question and on its own — that the design record's
      // `M4`, which forbade a second visual treatment here, is CHANGED.
      // ⛔ BOTH ARE HERS AND BOTH ARE TIER 2 — APPROVED AS SHOWN: an agent
      // wrote every question and every option label and she picked one; she
