      //   > must take `R3-4` as her later ruling and `M4` as superseded for
      //   > this pane."
      // ⛔ IT WAS TRUE WHEN IT LANDED AND A LATER PLAN IN THE SAME PHASE
      // MADE IT FALSE LESS THAN TWO HOURS LATER THE SAME MORNING — 26.96-27
      // wrote it at `1384cc4` (02:30:39) and 26.96-29 discharged the rewrite
      // at `7c9f998` (04:22:25). ⚠ It is the reader who paid: told to carry
      // a contradiction that no longer existed, and told a rewrite was
