      //
      // ⛔ AND HALF OF `M4` SURVIVES UNTOUCHED — do not read the correction
      // as the whole rule falling. The two lists are DIFFERENT MECHANISMS
      // ("kept out of the room entirely" vs "the librarian may never read
      // it"), they are kept apart BY COPY, and ⛔ THIS PANE MUST NEVER CLAIM
      // TO GOVERN WHAT COMES IN. That half was never in question, still
      // binds, and `hardNegatives` in tests/test_roster_pane.cjs holds it on
      // rendered output.
      //
      // ⛔ 26.96-28 CLOSED TWO OF THE THREE GAPS THE TRACER LEFT: typing now
      // narrows the offered list and her S-3 sentence is said when nothing
      // matches. ⚠ THE THIRD IS DELIBERATELY STILL OPEN and is written down
      // rather than implied: there is NO empty state for an offered list that
