      // `loadRosterFolderChoices` fails closed into.
      // ⭐⭐ 26.96-34 — HER RULING R OF 2026-08-23. THIS BLOCK IS EMITTED
      // ONLY WHERE FOLDERS READ FROM HER VAULT CAN ACTUALLY BE OFFERED.
      //
      //   Q: "On the screen where the room first offers to bring your vault
