  // ⚠ THE DASH IS AN EM DASH and the lowercase `i` is hers. Do not smooth
  // either, and do not sentence-case the line.
  // ⚠ ONE CONTIGUOUS LITERAL, and double-quoted because her sentence carries
  // an apostrophe — split across a `+` the byte-pin cannot see it, which the
