  // THE LEAD-IN IS CONDITIONAL ON PURPOSE. "i'd", not "i have" and not
  // "here are yours": a proposal she may walk past, in the shipped lowercase
  // first-person register. Opening a row promotes nothing, blesses nothing
  // and shelves nothing — only she promotes.
